GET http://localhost:5027/api/admissions/parents
Accept: application/json



### Register a new Staff Member
POST http://localhost:5027/api/staff
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Uthman Al-Khattab",
  "email": "uthman@alizza.sch.ng",
  "phone": "08099887766",
  "roleType": "Teacher",
  "qualification": "B.Sc Computer Science",
  "schoolId": "YOUR_SCHOOL_GUID_HERE"
}

### Get All Staff Members
GET http://localhost:5027/api/staff
Accept: application/json

### Get Staff by School ID
GET http://localhost:5027/api/staff/school/YOUR_SCHOOL_GUID_HERE
Accept: application/json


### Create Academic Class
POST http://localhost:5027/api/academics/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "JSS 1 Gold",
  "schoolId": "YOUR_SCHOOL_GUID_HERE"
}

### Add Subject to Class
POST http://localhost:5027/api/academics/subjects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arabic Language",
  "code": "ARB101",
  "academicClassId": "YOUR_CLASS_GUID_HERE"
}